      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure what you mean by implicit. The test binary needs to have a different main function to the real binary. The built-in test framework does that by having a special compiler pass to add its own main function in place of it, but I can\u0027t see any way to do that in a custom test harness. We can\u0027t have two main functions.",
